\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Hark! hark, my soul! Angelic
\par songs are swelling
\par All earth's green fields and ocean's
\par wave- beat shore:
\par How sweet the truth those blessed
\par strains are telling
\par Of that new life when sin shall be
\par no more!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Angels of Jesus, angels of
\par light,
\par Singing to welcome the pilgrims
\par of the night!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Onward we go; for still we hear
\par them singing:
\par Come, weary souls, for Jesus bids
\par you come;
\par And through the dark, its echoes
\par sweetly ringing,
\par The music of the gospel leads us 
\par home.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Angels of Jesus, angels of
\par light,
\par Singing to welcome the pilgrims
\par of the night!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Far, far away, like bells at evening
\par pealing,
\par The voice of Jesus sounds o'er land 
\par and sea,
\par And laden souls, by thousands
\par meekly stealing,
\par Kind Shepherd, turn their weary
\par steps to Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Angels of Jesus, angels of
\par light,
\par Singing to welcome the pilgrims
\par of the night!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Rest comes at length; though life
\par be long and dreary;
\par The day must dawn and darksome 
\par night be past;
\par Faith's journey ends in welcomes
\par to the weary,
\par And heaven, the heart's true home,
\par will come at last.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Angels of Jesus, angels of
\par light,
\par Singing to welcome the pilgrims
\par of the night!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Angels, sing on, your faithful
\par watches keeping;
\par Sing us sweet fragments of the
\par songs above,
\par Till morning's joy shall end the 
\par night of weeping,
\par And life's long shadows break 
\par in cloudness love.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

